e penalties the NCAA announced against Liberty, two coaches and the GM received show-cause penalties over tampering.","published":"2026-11-24T20:05:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50585093/ncaa-sanctions-liberty-transfer-portal-tampering","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star OT Lincoln Fa'alafi commits to Notre Dame, to join 2028 class","description":"New Zealand native Lincoln Fa'alafi, ESPN's No. 8 overall prospect in the 2028 cycle, committed Tuesday to Notre Dame.","published":"2026-11-24T19:56:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50584881/notre-dame-gets-2028-commitment-ot-lincoln-faalafi","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"A timeline of Michigan athletics since 2017","description":"Warde Manuel's eventful decade in Ann Arbor has been marked by athletic successes and marred by controversy.","published":"2026-11-24T18:47:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49351177/2026-michigan-warde-manuel-athletic-department-tenure-line-investigation","type":"Story","byline":"Paolo Uggetti","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios in Week 13?","description":"Plenty of spots are still up for grabs entering the final week of the regular season.","published":"2026-11-24T18:22:10.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583399/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-13","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Trev Alberts told he won't be Michigan AD after agreement","description":"Trev Alberts was \"shocked and disheartened\" to be informed by the search firm representing Michigan that he will not be the Wolverines' next AD, he told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-24T23:01:32.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50583155/attorney-trev-alberts-told-next-ad-michigan","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Dan Wetzel","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman race for Week 12: Wake Forest's Gio Lopez makes late push","description":"Much like his team, the Demon Deacons' QB has slipped under the radar much of the season -- but no more.","published":"2026-11-24T11:31:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50573849/heisman-race-wake-forest-gio-lopez","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5147146/fred-johnson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fred_Johnson_(linebacker)"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Fred Johnson (linebacker)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fred_Johnson_(linebacker)","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Frederick B. \"JayR\" Johnson is an American football linebacker for the South Carolina Gamecocks.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Johnson attended Matthew Fontaine Maury High School in Norfolk, Virginia. He was rated as a three-star recruit, 51st overall linebacker, and the 521st overall player in the class of 2024, and committed to play college football for the South Carolina Gamecocks over offers from other schools such as Duke, Rutgers, and Virginia Tech."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"As a freshman in 2024, Johnson totaled six tackles and a quarterback hurry. He entered his sophomore season in 2025 as a starter at linebacker for the Gamecocks. In the season opener, Johnson notched 10 tackles and an interception in a win over Virginia Tech Hokies. He finished the season with 61 tackles with three and a half going for a loss, a sack, three pass deflections, an interception, and a fumble recovery in 12 starts."}]}}